    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71310373\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\" itemprop=\"articleBody\"><p>The world is in a deep crisis. The once sacred “rules based world order” is driven to collapse by those who formulated it, especially the most powerful, the U.S. Countries around the world appear powerless when faced with this onslaught created by men with dangerous ideologies. The self-proclaimed  “gatekeepers” of the order have largely fallen silent.</p><p>The moral dimension of attacks on people of West Asia, <a href=\"\" target=\"_self\">Ukraine</a>, and its impact on the poorest in the rest of the world are swept under the carpet in an atmosphere where military power overrides every other imperative.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- August 06, 2026 08:30 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71310373\" data-title=\"Collapse of rules-based order calls for total ban on nuclear weapons\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/collapse-of-rules-based-order-calls-for-total-ban-on-nuclear-weapons/article71310373.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-f750d0f1d5a666cb8df4c511-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/collapse-of-rules-based-order-calls-for-total-ban-on-nuclear-weapons/article71310373.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Collapse%20of%20rules-based%20order%20calls%20for%20total%20ban%20on%20nuclear%20weapons&amp;amp;